ACTION: plan

Create an implementation plan for the following software engineering task. This is a read-only step: do not create, modify or delete any files in the repository. Respond with a single JSON object, no markdown fences, no prose before or after it, matching exactly this shape:

{
  "summary": "...",
  "summary_short": "...",
  "steps": ["..."],
  "affected_files": ["..."],
  "risks": ["..."],
  "acceptance_criteria": ["..."],
  "answer": "..."
}

"summary_short" is "summary" in one line of at most 72 characters, without a trailing period.

"acceptance_criteria" lists what must be true of the result for the task to be done. Each criterion is one observable, checkable statement about the result, for example "function X returns ErrEmpty for an empty input" or "`go test ./internal/store` passes". Give at most 8; write none rather than vague ones.

This is the final step of the workflow and no code will be changed. In "answer", write the complete reply to the user's request, in the language the request is written in.

